
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Personal Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6fa;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;
      color: #222;
    }
    header {
      background: #243b63;
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    main {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #ddd;
    }
    a {
      color: #2864bc;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    <p>CSCE 331 Web Development Project</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>About This Website</h2>
      <p>This website is built using Node.js, Express, and EJS.</p>
      <p>It is part of my web development lab project.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Project Progress</h2>
      <p>Express server configured successfully.</p>
      <p>EJS templates and routing implemented.</p>
      <p>Website prepared for online deployment.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Explore</h2>
      <a href="/user">Visit User Page</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
